<p class="lead">You cannot judge a roof from the driveway. Hail bruises, lifted shingle seals, cracked pipe boots and loose flashing are almost invisible from the ground, yet they are exactly what causes leaks months later. A free Austin roof inspection from Austin Roofing puts a trained roofer on your roof and gives you dated photos of its real condition, so you can make decisions based on facts.</p>

<p>We inspect shingle, metal and low-slope roofs on homes, rental properties, multi-family buildings and commercial properties across Austin and Central Texas. Whether a storm just rolled through or you are about to close on a house, you get the same thorough, documented inspection.</p>

